//// blog — onze's acceptance app (front 53), module-tree root.
////
//// The routing tree lives under `src/app/` (`onze.json`'s `appDir`). It is
//// not reachable from here: its directory names (`[slug]`, `(marketing)`) are
//// not module identifiers, so `onze build` stages it under `.onze/app/` and
//// generates its `pub mod` lines (front 50). This root declares the modules an
//// app author reaches by a plain `mod` path.

pub mod lib;
